>
>This language *IS* a schism, Bob!

We are merely the latest generation of Loglan, though a version of the 
prior generation of Loglan continues to eke out an existence.  (TLI Loglan 
is 4th generation Loglan, and CLL Lojban could be considered 5th generation 
Loglan by the same counting scheme.  each generation has involved very 
substantial changes to the language, and its power of expression.)

JCB did NOT manage to prevent schism.

